      <h2 id="virt-vm-custom-scheduler_virt-schedule-vms" class="group scroll-mt-20">Scheduling virtual machines with a custom scheduler<a href="#virt-vm-custom-scheduler_virt-schedule-vms" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
